# ===== ASF GROUP =====

# --- Bog'liqliklar (dependencies) ---
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/

# --- Build natijalari ---
dist/
build/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Maxfiy sozlamalar (.env) ---
